# Component patterns

- Functional components + hooks only
- Use `immutability-helper` for context/reducer updates
- `useCallback` for handlers passed to children
- New public API: TypeScript; legacy form elements can stay JSX until touched
- ElementEditor sub-logic: `configs/`, `editors/`, `hooks/`, `utils/` under ElementEditor
- Custom fields: `Registry.register(name, Component)` in `src/utils/registry.ts`
- Props: support camelCase aliases via `src/utils/propAliases.ts` (keep snake_case working)
- Drag-and-drop: react-dnd v16 hooks (`useDrag`, `useDrop`)
- UI: Ant Design v6 — match existing Ant patterns in neighboring files
